Whitney Hodges: We will, you know, bid higher sometimes on females than on males. Like, if we find that those are the majority of people who are actually, you know, inquiring. We want to make sure, you know, that your venue is showing up for people who are in the right location, right? Not that, like, you know, somebody in New York is searching and you're showing up.

