01:30:05.000 --> 01:30:21.000
Whitney Hodges: a, testimonial from one of their brides, and then again, you know, they're including a link to schedule a tour. In your case, it could just be the question of, would you like to schedule a tour? Right? And if you wanna stop the sequence as soon as somebody replies, you could totally do that.

