Whitney Hodges: capture and engage with, um, repeatedly the leads that are coming in, because I know when we met, um, you know, the last time you were kind of saying that a lead comes in, you send out that first email.

01:31:02.000 --> 01:31:13.000
Whitney Hodges: and if they don't respond, then they don't respond, right? But this way, it's like, those leads are getting followed up with, without you having to be the ones to do it. Um…

